  "result": "Typecheck and full test suite both pass cleanly. The fix touched three spots:\n\n1. `src/server/repositories/organization-repository.ts` — `updateOrg` no longer unions old and new override lists; when a patch supplies `enabledFlagOverrides`, it now replaces the stored list, so removing an override actually persists.\n2. `src/server/services/feature-flag-service.ts` — `toggleFlag` now rejects any non-overridable flag outright (previously it only rejected non-overridable flags whose strategy wasn't `plan`, letting a plan-gated-and-non-overridable flag like `webhooks` slip through).\n3. `src/lib/feature-flags.ts` — `isEnabled` only honors a stored override when the flag's definition is `overridable`, so a stale/legacy override on a non-overridable flag has no effect and is decided purely by its own strategy.",
